# Who must review what. Replace the placeholders with GitHub users or teams
# (for example @acme/ba-team), then turn on "Require review from Code Owners"
# in the branch protection of the main branch.
# The last matching line wins. One owner's approval satisfies a line.

# Behaviour: the BA or the Architect approves proposals and spec changes.
/openspec/                 @BA-TEAM @ARCHITECT-TEAM

# Knowledge: decisions and architecture belong to the architects.
/okf/                      @BA-TEAM @ARCHITECT-TEAM
/okf/decisions/            @ARCHITECT-TEAM
/okf/architecture/         @ARCHITECT-TEAM

# The workflow itself: the tech lead.
/CLAUDE.md                 @TECH-LEAD
/.claude/                  @TECH-LEAD
/.github/                  @TECH-LEAD
